# Scratch / working notes (review artifacts versioned in e76d0a1)

# Agent-files convention (see AGENTS.md): the central Devman link plane owns
# .agents/ and .claude/; neither is tracked in this project. `.agents` has no
# trailing slash on purpose: it is a symlink, and git matches a symlink only
# without the slash.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
.agents
.claude/

# The machine-local devenv input overlay. devenv.yaml is committed in its portable
# FLEET shape (published tags); this file points the same inputs at THIS machine's
# working trees.
devenv.local.yaml
